      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Anthropic opens Singapore office and signs MOU with the Government of Singapore",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we are expanding our Asia-Pacific operations by opening a new office in Singapore—our fifth in the region—and signing a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) with the Singapore Ministry of Digital Development and Information.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Singapore is one of our most active markets anywhere in the world, and Claude is already powering Singaporean business and government services used by millions of people every day, like GovTech Singapore, Grab, and DBS.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“This partnership with Anthropic reflects the Government’s commitment to scaling up the responsible adoption of AI, deepening capabilities in our companies and government agencies, and delivering impact for Singapore.”",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Our work with Singapore goes back to 2023, when we joined the Generative AI Evaluation Sandbox run by the Infocomm Media Development Authority and the AI Verify Foundation.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Under the MOU, we plan to hold technical exchanges with Singapore’s AI safety, security, and assurance institutions on model evaluation, testing standards, and incident response.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We plan to share research and data with the government, including from the Anthropic Economic Index , and to offer technical and policy expertise as Singapore develops its rules for AI.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In our latest Economic Index , Singapore ranks second of 121 countries in Claude.ai usage relative to its population, at nearly six times what its size alone would predict.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In the public sector, more than 1,500 engineers and technical staff at the Government Technology Agency of Singapore (GovTech Singapore) have adopted Claude Code to modernize government systems and speed up software delivery.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we hosted Builder Summit Singapore, bringing more than 300 developers together with engineering and product leaders from Anthropic.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Earlier in the week, Singapore’s Claude community ambassadors held a meetup for more than 700 local builders.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/singapore-office-opening",
        "source": "Anthropic",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T08:30:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-19T16:58:50.753Z"
      }
